  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Elite Hex Spell. For 10 seconds, target foe casts enchantments 100...180...200% slower. If target foe is not under the effects of an enchantment when this hex is applied, that foe takes 10...82...100 damage and all adjacent foes take 75% of that damage.",
